{
    "title": "Spades Solitaire - Card Games",
    "description": "Welcome to the all-new Spades card game! If you love popular casual card games like Hearts, Rummy, Euchre, or Pinochle, you'll enjoy this free game. Spades Solitaire is easy to pick up but full of strategy and challenges, allowing you to enjoy the fun of casual card games while training your brain!\r\n\r\n\r\nOffline mode lets you play the most popular casual card game without the internet. Join the exciting battles in Spades Solitaire, and train your brain anytime! Even better, Spades Solitaire is completely free, allowing you to fully experience the fun of casual card games without any in-app purchases. Unlock new challenges and rewards for free, ensuring that each match is refreshing.\r\n\r\n\r\nSpades Solitaire combines features from casual card games like Hearts, Canasta, Euchre, and Pinochle, offering rich strategy and teamwork fun. Challenge smart AI opponents, whether online or offline, each has a unique playing style. This is a perfect game for brain training, boosting your memory and decision skills. With a beautiful interface and smooth gameplay, you\u2019ll have a realistic card game experience. Whether you are a novice or a seasoned player, Spades Solitaire provides endless fun to satisfy all your casual card game needs!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1How to play Spades Solitaire - Card Games?\ud83d\udca1\r\nIn this free Spades card game, four players, are divided into two or four teams. Like Hearts and Callbreak, each player receives 13 cards, with spades being the trump suit, always greater than others. Cleverly playing spades is the key to winning.\r\n\r\n1. Bidding: Each player bids on the number of tricks they expect to win.\r\n\r\n2. Playing or Following Suit: One player starts playing a card, and then others play with cards of the same suit in order.\r\n\r\n3. Discarding or Playing Spades: If you don't have a card of the same suit, you can play a card of another suit or a spade.\r\n\r\n4. Winning the Trick: In each round, the player with the highest card wins. \r\n\r\n5. If a spade is played, the rank of the spade determines the highest.\r\nCompleting Bid Goals: After all cards are played, points are awarded or deducted based on the players' bids and the number of tricks actually won.\r\n\r\n6. Winning: After several rounds, the team that first reaches the preset score wins.\r\n\r\nSpades Solitaire also provides tutorials to help you learn this fun and free card game! Relax and train your brain while playing multiplayer games offline against smart AI, and aim for the highest title in the card game! If you like casual card games like Euchre, Pinochle, Rummy, and Hearts, it's perfect for you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2728\ufe0fFeatures of Spades Solitaire - Card Games:\u2728\ufe0f\r\n\r\n\u2660 100% Free: No in-app purchases, enjoy the complete fun of casual card games for free.\r\n\r\n\u2660 Two Gameplay Rules: Spades Solitaire has two popular card game rules, Standard and New York City.\r\n\r\n\u2660 Two Difficulty Levels: Beginner and Advanced, suitable for card game players of all ages.\r\n\r\n\u2660 Three Game Modes: Single-player, cooperative, and competitive; enjoy the fun of casual card games in different modes.\r\n\r\n\u2660 Six Custom Rules: Customize your own casual card game rules to make each play unique.\r\n\r\n\u2660 Thirty-Eight Achievements: Compete with casual card game enthusiasts and prove you are a master of card games.\r\n\r\n\u2660 Multiple Free Themes and Avatars: Experience the most personalized and creative casual card game.\r\n\r\n\u2660 Offline Mode: You can play Spades Solitaire anytime, and train your brain.\r\n\r\n\u2660 Smart AI: Enjoy a realistic card game experience with smart AI; fans of Euchre, Pinochle, Rummy, and Hearts will want to try this.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaeDownload Spades Solitaire - Card Games Now\ud83c\udfae\r\nWhether you are looking for a relaxing card game or want to train your brain, Spades Solitaire can perfectly meet your needs. Play exciting battles with smart AI, every play is full fresh, and exciting. Plus, this casual card game is completely free and supports offline, so you can play anytime, anywhere. Join millions of card game enthusiasts worldwide and experience the fun of Spades Solitaire!",
